      "text": "the speciality of this chain is output of first block will be input for second block, output of\nsecond block willl be input for third block and so on.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "the speciality of this chain is output of first block will be input for second block, output of\nsecond block willl be input for third block and so on.",
