      "seed": 226712799,
      "version": 866,
      "versionNonce": 184480497,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781198450971,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "in step 5 we have to write custom code,which is not LangChain code, it is pure\npython code, because Langchaing doesn't provide Loop. so we have written our code, whenever\nwe write our code this code is called glue code, less glue code  means good Langchain use.\nBecaue maintaing glue code is difficult. and that is why creating very big application using\nLangchaing is difficult. More glue code means maintaining code is difficult.\nLangChain works really well with Linear workflows but when nonlenearity comes into picture\nbuilding agent using Langchain difficult.\n34:30",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "in step 5 we have to write custom code,which is not LangChain code, it is pure\npython code, because Langchaing doesn't provide Loop. so we have written our code, whenever\nwe write our code this code is called glue code, less glue code  means good Langchain use.\nBecaue maintaing glue code is difficult. and that is why creating very big application using\nLangchaing is difficult. More glue code means maintaining code is difficult.\nLangChain works really well with Linear workflows but when nonlenearity comes into picture\nbuilding agent using Langchain difficult.\n34:30",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "70UXCpXD5DaLYRSD7svDr",
